  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Learning and Monitoring in the Rift Lake Valley</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This assignment supports continuity of integrated water resources management (IWRM) efforts in Ethiopia&#x2019;s Rift Valley Lake Basin by providing interim technical and institutional support to the Rift Valley Lakes Basin Administration Office. The work focuses on consolidating results from earlier FDW-supported projects, maintaining key monitoring and data systems, and translating lessons learned into practical inputs for the upcoming BRIGHT river basin management programme. The activity aims to help sustain institutional capacity and ensure that knowledge generated through previous projects informs future basin management initiatives.</narrative>
  </description>
